[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3304485310","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110591#issuecomment-3304485310","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110591","id":3304485310,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E9nG-","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T20:35:00Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T20:35:00Z","body":"@jrouwe Unfortunately I don't have access to a decent profiler right at this moment, but the Visual Studio profiler points towards something weird going on in `JPH::EPAPenetrationDepth::GetPenetrationDepthStepEPA`.\n\n<img width=\"931\" height=\"454\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9e7796db-e5e6-4abc-9eeb-1698fa207ab2\" />\n\n(Note that this particular `ShapeCast3D` is done with a cast vector of zero, so is effectively a shape query rather than a shape cast, so there's no `PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.cast_motion` involved.)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3304485310/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3309506853","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110591#issuecomment-3309506853","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110591","id":3309506853,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FQxEl","user":{"login":"jrouwe","id":1621693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjE2OTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1621693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe","html_url":"https://github.com/jrouwe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-18T20:10:26Z","updated_at":"2025-09-18T20:12:12Z","body":"The EPA algorithm has a weak point and that is if 2 shapes that have a curved surface (capsules, spheres) perfectly align. As there are infinitely many directions of pushing the 2 shapes apart that all have the same penetration depth, it starts doing a lot of iterations trying to find the deepest hit. If you do this with 50 shapes at the same time, I can imagine this becoming really slow.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3309506853/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3309761229","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110591#issuecomment-3309761229","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110591","id":3309761229,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FRvLN","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-18T21:20:01Z","updated_at":"2025-09-18T21:23:11Z","body":"Gotcha. Thank you for taking a look. I assume Godot Physics avoids problem this by virtue of using SAT then (more specifically [this](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4fcd85551cb8b5de5b876ee4e93f72a816713c58/modules/godot_physics_3d/godot_collision_solver_3d_sat.cpp#L772-L823) solver)?\n\n@toiletwarrior2 Was this in any way a blocker for you, or just something you happened to stumble upon?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3309761229/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3313159893","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110591#issuecomment-3313159893","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110591","id":3313159893,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Fes7V","user":{"login":"toiletwarrior2","id":200650435,"node_id":"U_kgDOC_Wuww","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200650435?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/toiletwarrior2","html_url":"https://github.com/toiletwarrior2","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toiletwarrior2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toiletwarrior2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toiletwarrior2/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toiletwarrior2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toiletwarrior2/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toiletwarrior2/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toiletwarrior2/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toiletwarrior2/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toiletwarrior2/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-19T17:41:06Z","updated_at":"2025-09-19T17:50:04Z","body":"It was something that I just happened to stumble upon, not a blocker for me.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3313159893/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315031724","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110591#issuecomment-3315031724","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110591","id":3315031724,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Fl16s","user":{"login":"jrouwe","id":1621693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjE2OTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1621693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe","html_url":"https://github.com/jrouwe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-20T14:52:35Z","updated_at":"2025-09-20T14:52:35Z","body":"> Gotcha. Thank you for taking a look. I assume Godot Physics avoids problem this by virtue of using SAT then (more specifically [this](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4fcd85551cb8b5de5b876ee4e93f72a816713c58/modules/godot_physics_3d/godot_collision_solver_3d_sat.cpp#L772-L823) solver)?\n\nLooking at that code, it appears that godot physics has a few more specializations for specific shape type pairs. An analytical (instead of iterative) sphere vs sphere test seems to be one of them. This would be easy to do for Jolt as well, and would resolve this particular issue. Reason that it hasn't been done yet is that supporting every permutation of shape type and collision test with specialized implementations is tedious. So, I only did it for types that took significant time in my use cases (tested by enabling `JPH_TRACK_NARROWPHASE_STATS`). ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315031724/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315034359","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110591#issuecomment-3315034359","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110591","id":3315034359,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Fl2j3","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-20T14:57:54Z","updated_at":"2025-09-20T14:57:54Z","body":"> Reason that it hasn't been done yet is that supporting every permutation of shape type and collision test with specialized implementations is tedious.\n\nWould a report like this justify adding a specialization for sphere versus sphere, or do we just document this as a gotcha and leave it at that?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315034359/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315042929","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110591#issuecomment-3315042929","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110591","id":3315042929,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Fl4px","user":{"login":"jrouwe","id":1621693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjE2OTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1621693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe","html_url":"https://github.com/jrouwe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-20T15:12:28Z","updated_at":"2025-09-20T15:12:28Z","body":"I can fix sphere vs sphere (which I might if I have a bit of time), but then someone will come along and do the same thing for capsule vs capsule and after fixing that someone will come with sphere vs capsule, and then tapered capsule vs capsule and then tapered capsule vs sphere and then cylinder vs cylinder and then...\n\nNote that it only triggers if the shapes are exactly aligned (an offset of 1 mm is probably already enough to make it converge fast). I think is a very rare case to happen and even rarer for multiple shape pairs to be in this state at the same time.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315042929/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315063138","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110591#issuecomment-3315063138","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110591","id":3315063138,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Fl9li","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-20T15:44:39Z","updated_at":"2025-09-20T15:44:39Z","body":"> an offset of 1 mm is probably already enough to make it converge fast\n\nI can confirm this.\n\nSeeing as how this wasn't really a problem for the reporter in the first place, I'll go ahead and just close this as an acceptable quirk for now. If you find the time to add said sphere-versus-sphere specialization, then that's great, but clearly it wouldn't resolve this issue fully anyway.\n\nIf we end up getting more reports like this then we can either see about documenting it, or discuss adding more shape pair specializations I guess.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315063138/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]